s></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HONDA AKIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUGAYA TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMANOUCHI MASAYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASE, HIROMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HONDA, AKIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUGAYA, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMANOUCHI, MASAYA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method for screening or identifying remedies or preventives for kidney diseases characterized by examining the effect of a test compound of potentiating the expression of a protein binding to a fatty acid; a novel mouse proximal convoluted tubule endothelial cell line useful therein; remedies or preventives for kidney diseases containing as the active ingredient a drug having an effect of potentiating the expression of a protein binding to a fatty acid; and fatty acid-binding protein expression potentiators and remedies or preventives for kidney diseases comprising compounds having a peroxisome proliferator-activated receptor (PPAR) agonism, a carnitine palmitoyltransferase (CPT) inhibitory effect, etc.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention concerne un procédé de criblage et d'identification de moyens curatifs ou préventifs pour affections rénales. Ce procédé consiste à étudier un composé test et son action de potentialisation de l'expression d'une protéine se liant à un acide gras. L'invention concerne également une nouvelle lignée cellulaire endothéliale de tubes contournés proximaux chez la souris ; des médicaments curatifs ou préventifs des affections rénales, renfermant comme principe actif une substance capable de potentialiser l'expression d'une protéine se liant à un acide gras et des agents et médicaments capables de potentialiser l'expression de protéines qui se lient à des acides gras ou des médicaments préventifs des affections rénales renfermant des composés ayant une activité agoniste à l'égard d'un récepteur activé par un proliférateur de péroxisome (PPAR), un effet inhibiteur sur la carnitine palmitoyltranférase (CPT), etc.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>